      },
      "description": "An opaque process-lifetime monotonic result-allocation ownership identity stored in MermanNativeResult.allocation_token. The low-bit domain tag rejects accidental engine-token use, every issued value remains positive when projected through a signed 64-bit host integer, and the token is not an authorization boundary."
